1. Connect as SYSDBA
sqlplus / as sysdba


2. Check the current HTTPS port
SELECT DBMS_XDB_CONFIG.GETHTTPSPORT() FROM dual;


3. Set it to 5500
EXEC DBMS_XDB_CONFIG.SETHTTPSPORT(5500);


Then verify:
SELECT DBMS_XDB_CONFIG.GETHTTPSPORT() FROM dual;

It should return:
5500


4. Make sure the database is running
SELECT status FROM v$instance;


If it isn't OPEN:
STARTUP;


5. Access EM Express
Open: 
https://localhost:5500/em


If you're accessing it from another machine, use:
https://<oracle-server-ip>:5500/em


